			},
			"date": "2023-02-15T22:42:43.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://glasgow.social/@patrick\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>patrick</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Short term is what matters. Good marketing gives you more time to build merit (or build the revenue to buy the merit). </p><p>There are absolutely niches where Merit will matter more, but those areas are just that: niche.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
