			},
			"date": "2023-02-16T11:40:05.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I’ve been forced to build marketing websites using SharePoint once. This software did not succeed (for the few years it was successfully pushed as a CMS solution…) on its merits, that’s for sure.</p>",
